# A global ignore of `build/` is common (and is in effect on at least one dev
# machine), but the Windows icon + manifest SOURCES live in build/ and must be
# tracked — without them `just build-icon` cannot regenerate the resource and
# wootc.exe silently loses its icon. Re-include the directory, then re-exclude
# the compiled output inside it.
!build/
build/bin

node_modules
frontend/dist
